ang Valora Possession Date | 01 December 2031 |\n| Towers in Narang Valora | 2 |\n\n### Narang Valora Floor Plan","score":0.86108357,"raw_content":null,"id":"215da8-04"},{"url":"https://www.99acres.com/narang-valora-goregaon-mumbai-andheri-dahisar-npxid-r467679","title":"Narang Valora, Goregaon, Mumbai - Price starting at 3.68 Cr","content":"Yes, this is a RERA-registered project. PR1180002600544 is the RERA number of Narang Valora that can be used to search more details aboubt the project on the","score":0.8464638,"raw_content":null,"id":"3da61f-05"}],"response_time":0.88,"request_id":"dcde8878-f667-4b0b-9764-a7b1539f4a19"}